&lt;li&gt;Define and track platform adoption goals, activation KPIs, and business metrics, continuously refining go-to-market strategies to improve developer adoption and create scalable, repeatable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the voice of developers and strategic partners, translating customer insights into actionable recommendations that influence product strategy, roadmap prioritization, positioning, and future platform investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Business Marketing, Developer Relations, and Communications to establish Discord&#39;s thought leadership within the gaming developer ecosystem through industry events, customer stories, technical content, and strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional go-to-market planning and execution across Product Management, Engineering, Business Development, Developer Operations, Developer Relations, Marketing, Design, and Legal to ensure successful product launches and organizational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
