&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Product Marketing experience in B2B technology, gaming, developer platforms, SaaS, APIs, SDKs, or platform businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing go-to-market strategies for technical products and driving adoption through Business Development, Partnerships, or other customer-facing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable enablement programs, including messaging, positioning, launch materials, training, playbooks, and customer collateral.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of developer ecosystems, technical audiences, and how to translate complex platform capabilities into compelling customer value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
